"<div class="screen container Profile" data-screen="Profile"><div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6" style=""><h1 class="scroll-m-20 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--fg-primary)]">Edit Profile</h1>
